WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.452
Today we will notice how art can carry cultural meaning. Our work connects with other

00:00:05.452 --> 00:00:06.152
Ghanaian communities.

00:00:07.033 --> 00:00:10.212
Look at a cloth pattern and point to its repeated marks.

00:00:11.033 --> 00:00:13.999
Sketch two repeated shapes from the cloth onto paper.

00:00:15.033 --> 00:00:20.409
Add one personal variation and explain what it represents. Compare your result with a

00:00:20.409 --> 00:00:21.945
second example from Ghana.
